    "Il primo organo ricordato dalle fonti proveniva dal convento della Maddalena ed era stato acquistato per seicento franchi. Il pulpito, costruito nel 1784, fu in seguito rifatto vicino al pilastro sul lato del Vangelo.": "The first organ mentioned in the sources came from the Convent of the Maddalena and was bought for six hundred francs. The pulpit, built in 1784, was later remade near the pillar on the Gospel side.",
